      "text": "I joined this place for swiming. The pool is medium size not very deep. The depth of Half is 70 amd other half is 120. Overall nice place. They have gym facility also. They have beauty services massages etc. The swim board and typres are not in good conditions. Overall cleanliness is good. They have chairs and tables around the pool to sit and relax.\nAlso have a small cafetaria plus tuc shop at the poolside.",
